@wheezy announced that he is in the works of getting a pack of songs likely including grails to be run. Seller claims he is waiting for bitcoin to go back up so he can earn sufficient funds from bitcoin donations. Funds from Samurai GB were transferred over to this buy due to the scam, buy would've been $25,000.

